name: ['Altar of the Pantheon', 'Arcane Signet', 'Arlinn Kord // Arlinn, Embraced by the Moon', "Arlinn, the Pack's Hope // Arlinn, the Moon's Fury", "Azor's Gateway // Sanctum of the Sun", 'Bala Ged Recovery // Bala Ged Sanctuary', 'Barkchannel Pathway // Tidechannel Pathway', 'Beast Whisperer', 'Beast Within', 'Blightstep Pathway // Searstep Pathway', 'Branchloft Pathway // Boulderloft Pathway', 'Brightclimb Pathway // Grimclimb Pathway', 'Butcher of Malakir', 'Chandra, Fire of Kaladesh // Chandra, Roaring Flame', 'Chromatic Lantern', 'Clearwater Pathway // Murkwater Pathway', 'Command Tower', "Commander's Sphere", 'Cosima, God of the Voyage // The Omenkeel', 'Cragcrown Pathway // Timbercrown Pathway', 'Darkbore Pathway // Slitherbore Pathway', 'Dennick, Pious Apprentice // Dennick, Pious Apparition', 'Diluvian Primordial', 'Dowsing Dagger // Lost Vale', 'Elbrus, the Binding Blade // Withengar Unbound', 'Emmara, Soul of the Accord', 'Evolving Wilds', 'Exotic Orchard', 'Farseek', 'Fellwar Stone', 'Forest', 'Frontier Bivouac', 'Garruk Relentless // Garruk, the Veil-Cursed', 'Guardian Project', "Hadana's Climb // Winged Temple of Orazca", 'Hagra Mauling // Hagra Broodpit', 'Harmonize', 'Hengegate Pathway // Mistgate Pathway', 'Island', "Jace, Vryn's Prodigy // Jace, Telepath Unbound", 'Jolrael, Mwonvuli Recluse', 'Journey to Eternity // Atzal, Cave of Eternity', 'Jungle Shrine', 'Kinnan, Bonder Prodigy', 'Kolvori, God of Kinship // The Ringhart Crest', 'Kytheon, Hero of Akros // Gideon, Battle-Forged', "Legion's Landing // Adanto, the First Fort", 'Liliana, Heretical Healer // Liliana, Defiant Necromancer', "Ludevic, Necrogenius // Olag, Ludevic's Hubris", 'Meteor Golem', 'Mila, Crafty Companion // Lukka, Wayward Bonder', 'Mountain', 'Needleverge Pathway // Pillarverge Pathway', 'Nissa, Vastwood Seer // Nissa, Sage Animist', 'Ondu Inversion // Ondu Skyruins', 'Opulent Palace', 'Path of Ancestry', 'Plains', 'Plargg, Dean of Chaos // Augusta, Dean of Order', 'Pongify', 'Putrefy', 'Rhys the Redeemed', 'Rimewood Falls', 'Riverglide Pathway // Lavaglide Pathway', 'Sandsteppe Citadel', 'Sandstone Oracle', 'Savage Lands', 'Scattered Groves', 'Search for Azcanta // Azcanta, the Sunken Ruin', 'Seaside Citadel', 'Shaile, Dean of Radiance // Embrose, Dean of Shadow', 'Sheltered Thicket', 'Sisay, Weatherlight Captain', 'Sol Ring', 'Sphinx of the Second Sun', 'Swamp', 'Terramorphic Expanse', 'Thaumatic Compass // Spires of Orazca', 'The World Tree', 'Time Wipe', 'Tireless Provisioner', "Tovolar's Huntmaster // Tovolar's Packleader", 'Treasure Map // Treasure Cove', 'Triplicate Titan', "Urza's Ruinous Blast", 'Utter End', 'Valakut Awakening // Valakut Stoneforge', 'Valentin, Dean of the Vein // Lisette, Dean of the Root', 'Valki, God of Lies // Tibalt, Cosmic Impostor', 'Vivid Grove', 'Voldaren Pariah // Abolisher of Bloodlines', 'Woodland Chasm', 'Zetalpa, Primal Dawn']
